cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If DigitalGens contributed to your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "DigitalGens"
abstract: >-
  Free, fully client-side web server for nucleic-acid assay design: genotyping
  (KASP and allele-specific PCR, TaqMan/MGB/beacon probes, castPCR, SNaPshot,
  MLPA and digitalMLPA, STR/SSR, toehold-exchange probes, knock-in and
  recombinase-site assays), PCR and multiplex panels, LAMP, CRISPR, gene
  assembly, in silico PCR and sequence analysis. All computation runs in the
  browser; no account is required.
